<p>I think the Unity models, for the most part, take away a lot of horror or charm present in their respective SCPs designs, even if they're impressive on a technical level. As they are now, they just look nice but that's it. I think I'd like these if they were actually put in an environment where they'd look more fitting and be able to stand out better. My issue inherent with the models still won't go away, but I wouldn't downvote over that at least.</p>
